From 6d6134efaf8e93f30eb37f8b3c124d766fa90375 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:22:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 61/65] base-B build fixes round 3: FFXFeature_Dx12 version
 lists via FfxVersionList, FSR2 DX11/DX12 device lists via
 State::Is/Last*Device, ARM64EC (no SEH in PluginApi/CrashDumps, no SSE fence,
 SetupAPI case, __FUNCTION__ concat), compat d3d12 agility (SAMPLER_DESC2,
 ID3D12Device11 slot type, Desc_1_2 accessor, 16BIT flag), duplicate
 cases/_lowResMVs, atomic shared_ptr, (void*) casts, legacy UpscalerTimeVk
 calls dropped (upstream gpu_time)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
